[37:31] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'have these exact test files. So rather than showing they can print twopoint text that every machine here can print, I\'d much rather see them print these tests and show the improvements and'

[37:43] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
