[37:57] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'what we\'ve already shown. But all this the machine does X while the important caveats live somewhere deeper or in the small print, it doesn\'t wow me. I\'m a professional pessimist. It just makes me'

[38:09] [scene:talk]
